  - >-
    Three years after calling it quits in January 2013, Underoath shocked heavy
    music by reuniting their classic six-piece lineup — critically welcoming
    founding drummer and clean vocalist Aaron Gillespie back after six years
    apart. Demand for the Rebirth Tour was so intense that San Francisco’s date
    had to be upgraded from The Regency Ballroom to The Warfield.
  - >-
    Each night functioned as a double-album catharsis: Underoath performed both
    They’re Only Chasing Safety (2004) and Define the Great Line (2006) in full,
    front to back, reigniting the band permanently.
